Subject: [PATCH] hss_led: integrate LED control and provide hss_ledctl

Base: OpenCCU-Base caec7573d289a4b36f322862f22b110903dddf45

Run the LED controller and status calculation in one process. Provide
hss_ledctl as its client invocation, explicit LED-class target selection,
and a minimal recovery build of the same controller.

Upstream: Not submitted (experimental OpenCCU integration)
Signed-off-by: Jens Maus <mail@jens-maus.de>

